[10.384833, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[36m┌─ L20 · THE PLANCK WALL — where the word 'deeper' breaks \u001b[2m────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m│  planck length 1.6×10⁻³⁵ m · planck time 5.4×10⁻⁴⁴ s\u001b[0m\r\n"]
