[11.518386, "o", "\r\u001b[2K│  \u001b[33mtotal zoom: ×10³³. physics verified at every stop — then the road ends,\r\n"]
[11.518499, "o", "│  \u001b[33mnot with a thing, but with the end of the CONCEPT of size.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[11.518517, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[36m┌─ L21 · THE EDGE — here be dragons \u001b[2m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[11.518532, "o", "\u001b[2m│  the honest inventory of what 'deeper' cannot currently answer\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[11.518542, "o", "│  \u001b[1m\u001b[33m? quantum gravity\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[11.518552, "o", "│    \u001b[2mno verified theory. strings: 10 extra dims, unproven. LQG: quantized space, unproven.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[11.598662, "o", "│  \u001b[1m\u001b[33m? vacuum catastrophe\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[11.59879, "o", "│    \u001b[2mQFT predicts empty-space energy 10¹²⁰× observed — worst miss in physics. machine works anyway.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[11.676189, "o", "│  \u001b[1m\u001b[33m? dark sector\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[11.676332, "o", "│    \u001b[2m~95% of the universe (dark energy ~68% + dark matter ~27%) unmeasured. we are the minority.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[11.753854, "o", "│  \u001b[1m\u001b[33m? measurement problem\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[11.753962, "o", "│    \u001b[2mL19. unsolved since 1927 — the longest-running spiral in science.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[11.834078, "o", "│  \u001b[1m\u001b[33m? holography / it-from-bit\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[11.834199, "o", "│    \u001b[2mreal math (AdS/CFT): a volume fully encoded on its boundary. proven in toy universes only.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[11.909784, "o", "│  every previous level answered. this one refuses. the bottom of 'as deep as\r\n│  we can' is a boundary of knowledge, drawn in 10⁻³⁵ m ink.\r\n"]
[11.909941, "o", "\r\n"]
[11.909986, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36m┌─ L22 · BELOW THE WALL — the map of the unverified \u001b[2m──────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[11.910028, "o", "\u001b[2m│  the last floor: not a place — a stack of hypotheses with no floor yet\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[12.04016, "o", "│  \u001b[1m\u001b[35m∴ string theory\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[12.040285, "o", "│    \u001b[2meverything = 1D filaments ~10⁻³⁵ m, modes = particles. needs 10 spatial dimensions. no unique experimental test to date. STATUS: UNVERIFIED.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[12.132882, "o", "│  \u001b[1m\u001b[35m∴ loop quantum gravity\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[12.133026, "o", "│    \u001b[2mspace and time themselves quantized; smallest volume ~4×10⁻¹⁰⁵ m³. no confirmed prediction. STATUS: UNVERIFIED.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[12.224809, "o", "│  \u001b[1m\u001b[35m∴ causal set theory\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[12.224977, "o", "│    \u001b[2mspacetime grows from a discrete partial order of events — 'before' is the only primitive. STATUS: UNVERIFIED.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[12.317676, "o", "│  \u001b[1m\u001b[35m∴ the holographic principle\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[12.317792, "o", "│    \u001b[2m3D reality fully encoded on a 2D boundary. exact for some toy universes (AdS/CFT); ours: UNKNOWN.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[12.410409, "o", "\r\n"]
[12.410513, "o", "│  \u001b[1mthis is maximum depth. not because we stopped digging — because the\r\n│  shovel is made of the thing we're digging in.\u001b[0m below the wall there is no\r\n│  'below'. there are proposals, beautifully drawn, none with a floor of their own.\r\n│  \u001b[31mdeepest we can go = a well-posed map of what we cannot reach.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[12.410537, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[31m  ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\r\n"]
[12.410551, "o", "  FINAL REPORT — THE COMPLETE DESCENT · L0 → L22 · MAXIMUM DEPTH REACHED\r\n  ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[12.410566, "o", "\r\n"]
